WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:03.484
Achhe product ko aisi pehchaan chahiye jo

00:00:03.484 --> 00:00:06.340
yaad rahe. Chaliye, ek cafe ka logo aur

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.572
poster bante hue dekhte hain.

00:00:08.912 --> 00:00:12.074
Pehle logo ka sketch banate hain. Yahaan

00:00:12.074 --> 00:00:15.050
coffee cup aur pahaad ko milaaya. Phir

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.561
cafe ke liye rang aur font chune.

00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:21.006
Ab poster mein iced coffee ki badi photo

00:00:21.006 --> 00:00:24.205
rakhi. Saath mein wahi logo aur ek chhota

00:00:24.205 --> 00:00:27.122
offer, taaki baat jaldi samajh aaye.

00:00:27.462 --> 00:00:30.394
Wahi campaign phone ke liye bhi taiyaar

00:00:30.394 --> 00:00:33.504
hai. Social post mein photo, logo aur rang

00:00:33.504 --> 00:00:36.881
wahi hain, bas layout mobile ke hisaab se hai.

00:00:37.221 --> 00:00:40.186
Ab dekhiye final look. Window poster,

00:00:40.186 --> 00:00:43.244
coffee bag aur social post. Har jagah ek

00:00:43.244 --> 00:00:44.819
hi brand dikhta hai.

00:00:45.159 --> 00:00:47.963
Logo, poster ya social post chahiye?

00:00:47.963 --> 00:00:50.948
Neeche contact karein. Batayein aapka

00:00:50.948 --> 00:00:54.295
business kya hai, aur design kahaan lagega.
